Generated by: scripts/coccinelle/misc/semicolon.cocci

Fixes: a52562c05bdf ("Bluetooth: mediatek: Add protocol support for MediaTek MT7668U USB devices")
CC: Sean Wang <sean.wang@mediatek.com>
